WEBVTT

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.090
Yes, I'm on my way.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.510
Yes, it'll be fine.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.760
Right, later.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.390
Congratulations on your marriage!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.040
Let me through!
I said, let me through!

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:43.580
Jeez!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.750
Why do I have to deliver
the students' congratulatory speech?

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:17.700
I never thought I'd have the pleasure
of seeing you off the battlefield.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:23.160
And here I thought nothing could ever
surprise me again, but these are chaotic times.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:31.420
The groom Sir Alexis Deux,
and bride Marrine Kreische.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.210
Entering!

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:48.310
The union between these youths
symbolizes the end of the longstanding war

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.900
between the Alliance and the Union.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.450
The unification of our family Crests

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:59.280
will result in the creation of the Grancrest,
the Emperor's Holy Seal.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.870
And after being ravaged by endless chaos,
Atlatan will know peace at last.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.430
No way...
Chaos Convergence?

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:32.320
You're in danger. Please step back!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.070
- Who are you?
- What's going on?

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.450
I'll explain later.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:46.790
Stop right there.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.790
Let me go!
I must disperse the Chaos!

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.550
N-No good...

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.580
What is that demon?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.500
The Demon Lord of Diabolos.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.670
I must help the archdukes!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.170
It's too late.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:43.850
The Demon Lord has raised
a dimensional barrier.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.430
Erupt!

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.850
Why has the Demon Lord appeared?

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.940
Can nothing be done?

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:00.360
Bow down before my Crest!

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.790
That's Archduke Kreische's Crest!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.830
Such a massive, complex glow!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.380
I will assist you!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.390
Could that be...

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.010
The Emperor's Holy Seal, the Grancrest?

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.180
That should be enough to...

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.710
Father!

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.720
<i>That was the Grand Hall Tragedy.</i>

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:19.230
<i>In the magical city of Aram,
on the Atlatan Continent,</i>

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:23.700
<i>split in two by the Factory Alliance
and the Fantasia Union,</i>

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:28.620
<i>the union of the two archdukes’ families
was broken by this incident.</i>

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.370
<i>The dream for peace was shattered,</i>

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:37.210
<i>and the flames of war rose once again
across the entire continent.</i>

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:54.520
Don't you think it's about time
you stopped sulking, Lady Siluca?

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.190
No way.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.520
Why do I have to serve some lewd count?

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.440
He'll only sign contracts with female students
from the magic university.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.650
Plus he picks them based on their looks!

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.330
And don't get me started
on this heinous uniform!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.040
I know he's a big shot Union noble,
but really!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:17.540
I've half a mind to void this contract
and go back to Aram!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.380
But contracts between mage and master
are absolute.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.550
Don't remind me.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:31.640
So that town was destroyed
by the Chaos as well?

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.850
That's on their negligent Lord.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:40.270
Still, you're an oddball, aren't you Irvin?

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.150
Being the Kreische family's chamberlain,

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:47.400
I didn't think you'd leave your post
to serve a fledgling mage like me.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:52.700
If I hadn't stopped you, Lady Siluca,
I might've saved my master.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:57.210
I left my post with the Kreische family
to atone for that.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.210
Lady Siluca.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.710
You on the carriage, halt!

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:08.430
We know there's a mage
riding in that carriage.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:12.010
The one entering into a contract
with Vilar, the Count of Artuk.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.810
What do you want?

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:19.600
Our Lord is a member of the Alliance.

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:22.110
Since the Count of Artuk is with the Union,

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.360
we can't allow mages
under contract with him to pass.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:28.570
Attacking a mage before her contract begins
is a violation of the treaty.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:31.820
If the contract is set,
then she's considered our enemy!

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.830
I hear you loud and clear.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.130
Lady Siluca...

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:45.210
If it's come to this, so be it.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.960
You can have your way with me.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.890
- So eager!
- Oh, really?

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.350
Hold up!

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:01.100
Hey, who the hell are you?

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.270
Seriously, who the hell are you?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.780
My name is Theo!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:14.740
Have you no sense,
attacking an innocent on the road?

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.750
A Crest?

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:24.330
That youth appears to be a Lord.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.170
Yes.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:28.670
But at that power level,
he can't even call himself a Knight.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:31.170
Are you a Lord from the Union?

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:34.430
I belong to neither the Union
nor the Alliance.

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.010
What should we do, Captain?

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:40.600
The opposition has both a mage and a Lord!

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:43.900
They say they can take on
a hundred opponents, single-handedly.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:45.940
Nothing but rumors!

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:51.700
I was promised a Crest from our Lord
if we succeed here.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:56.070
And once I have a Crest,
even I'll have a shot at becoming a Lord!

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:59.490
Crests are for protecting the people
from the Chaos!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.750
If Crests didn't fall into the hands
of ill-intentioned people like you,

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.460
there would be no meaningless wars!

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:08.460
Retreat at once!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.210
If you refuse,
I'll show you no mercy!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:13.260
What did you say, brat?!

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:25.150
If he gets into trouble, help him out.
I'd like to see what he’s capable of.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:33.740
Dammit!

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:37.530
He's just one man!
Surround him!

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.980
You'll pay for this!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:10.940
Well?

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.400
No one would accuse him
of having good sword skills.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.700
But, I wouldn't say
that he doesn't have potential.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:20.580
That so?

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:23.450
What do you have in mind, Lady Siluca?

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.250
Exactly what you're thinking yourself.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:30.960
I'll ask you to refrain, but just as a formality.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.130
But I've already made up my mind.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.550
Are you all right?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.430
Yeah, it's no concern.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:42.850
Never mind that.
Don’t you have something to say to me?

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.480
"Thank you for saving me from such peril!"
Something like that?

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:52.570
I have no intention of thanking you,
since I wasn't in any danger.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:55.240
There was no need to rescue me.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.110
Is that your way of saying I butted in?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:10:59.820
That's right.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:03.160
I'm Siluca Meletes, a mage.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.290
That man is Irvin, an Artist.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.790
Who did you receive your Crest from?

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:12.880
Receive?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.760
No, this is something I made
to exterminate demons.

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.380
You made a Crest from the Chaos Core?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:26.850
And what kind of world
do you wish to create with that Crest?

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:29.060
World?

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:34.070
Systina, where I was born,
has a high concentration of Chaos.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.110
Demons run rampant there.
And there are frequent natural disasters.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:45.290
Plus, scores of my people suffer under
the tyranny of the Union's Viscount Rossini.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:50.580
When I receive my title,
I'm going to head home and become a Lord.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:56.800
I want to suppress the Chaos with my Crest,
repulse the demons and prevent disasters.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:59.670
Those are fine intentions you have.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:06.220
But at your rank, you couldn't rule over
a single town, let alone Systina.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:08.100
I'm aware!

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:12.900
You could always pledge fealty to Rossini,
and have him make you a Lord.

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.690
I don't wish to serve a man like that!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:17.480
So you're giving up your dream?

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.940
I can't do that!

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:22.450
I'm going to raise my rank
by enhancing my own powers!

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.910
No matter how many years it takes!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.450
That so?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.960
In that case, I'll give you a hand.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:39.340
This world is rife with Chaos.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.760
Order has been lost,
and the laws of nature have been disrupted.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.930
Hence why we see impossible phenomena.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:50.310
One of them being the emergence
of demons from another world.

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:55.610
Which cast a shadow...
Over this world.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:04.320
Converge!
From Tartarus into Orthros!

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.170
What are you doing?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.590
A Crest's potency is determined
by the amount of Chaos it contains.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:30.850
If you defeat this and absorb its Chaos Core,
you can attain the rank of Knight!

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:36.060
If I die, I'm going to haunt you!

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:38.520
I wouldn't have it any other way!

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.310
Impressive!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.360
I-I was sure my number was up...

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.910
You better hurry,
or the Chaos Core will disperse.

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:15.870
Seriously...

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.020
Congratulations!

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:47.030
Your Crest has reached the rank of Knight!
You can enter into a contract with one mage.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:55.040
Can I do that with someone
other than you?

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.120
I am already committed to a contract.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.620
To think that you still want me...

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.670
No, I never said that, did I?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:11.680
I, Siluca Meletes...

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.560
...hereby enter into contract
with the Crest of Knight Theo...

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.140
...and swear eternal allegiance to him.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.610
You're the one forcing yourself on me, right?

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.400
Just give yourself to fate!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.620
Well, I guess I don't mind.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.080
Now then, shall we set off?

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.330
Where?

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.080
To war!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.880
Lord Mesto, just what were you thinking?

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:49.300
Attacking a mage before her contract goes
into effect is a major violation of our treaty.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:53.510
If you're charged,
they could strip you of your rank.

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:58.310
Why should Lords like us be stifled
by the damn Mages' Association's rules?

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:02.310
At any rate, you need to consult
Viscount Shakes, the leader of Clovis–

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:05.190
All you need to do is follow my orders.

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:08.530
As you wish.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.360
B-Bad news!

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:11.820
What's wrong?

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:16.450
A Lord named Theo is demanding
that you hand over your Crest and castle!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:20.200
Where the hell is this Lord from?
How many men are we up against?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:21.450
Three, sir!

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.000
Only three?

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.130
Who does he think he's dealing with?

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:33.010
Does he really think he can seize this castle
with just three people?

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:34.220
Oh, that’s enough.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.140
Who are you?

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.850
My name is Siluca Meletes.

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.440
Siluca?

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.020
I've heard of you.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:49.070
That you were sure to master every subject,
and become a Rainbow Mage.

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.030
Sorry to disappoint you.
I graduated with six colors.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:57.530
So you're the mage entering
into a contract with the Count of Artuk?

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:58.950
Yes.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.950
However, I'm now under contract
to Sir Theo here.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:05.540
Are you certain?
A mage who unilaterally voids a contract

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.670
will be penalized accordingly.

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:09.540
I believe this is destiny.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.880
Hey, what are you doing, Sartorus?

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:16.010
I order you in the name of my Crest.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:17.720
- Hurry and deal with these–
- Silence!

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:21.010
You've violated the treaty.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.350
Meaning you'll be stripped
of your rank and everything else.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:29.860
And your contract with me is now void.
I have no reason to follow your orders!

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:32.480
W-What did you say?

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:35.450
Now that it's come to this,
it's time to surrender your Crest,

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:38.320
and leave this land without further delay.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:42.790
Dammit!

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.420
This is all because you passed
through my domain!

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:06.890
Thank you very much.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:09.190
Why you...

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:17.700
Your Crest or your life,
which will you choose?

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:22.580
A-Anything but my life...
Please spare me!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:28.620
In that case,
relinquish your Crest to my Lord.

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:50.100
I, Mesto Meadrich, offer my Crest
to you as your own.

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:53.400
Please hold out your Crest, Sir Theo.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.160
Repeat after me.

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.370
I, Theo...

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.040
I, Theo...

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.080
Accept thy Crest...

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.040
Accept thy Crest...

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:12.830
...and receive it as my own.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.340
...and receive it as my own.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:20.630
And now, please lay
your own Crest against Mesto's.

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.610
Somehow, he seems pitiful, doesn't he?

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:44.570
The people living under such
a foolish Lord should be pitied.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:50.250
Even if you hadn't seized it, a Lord like that
would've lost his Crest eventually.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:55.920
Also, this means that along with his Crest,
you've inherited that Lord's domain.

00:20:57.050 --> 00:21:00.260
But whether the other Lords
in this area will recognize that...

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:03.800
Allow me to go speak with Viscount Shakes.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.520
That is, if Sir Theo will agree
to enter a contract with me.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:13.100
I welcome the chance to have a mage
with your experience and common sense.

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.860
Then I shall set off
to negotiate immediately.

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.860
There's no need for that.

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:24.990
Because Sir Theo is going
to announce that he’s joining the Union.

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:26.280
What's that?

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:28.990
But if he does,
he’ll be surrounded by enemies!

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:31.120
That's precisely what our Lord desires.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:37.170
What exactly are you planning
to make me do?

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.210
Didn't I tell you before?

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.840
That I was going to help you realize
the world you've envisioned.

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:46.390
I think I could end up dead
before I ever realize my dream.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:47.970
You'll be fine!

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:54.270
Because you'll have me by your side.

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:05.030
CONTRACT

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
EPISODE 2:
AMBITION
